<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-DBS Land H1 1997 net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-DBS Land H1 1997 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			(in million S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				113.46     vs    100.58</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)			11.9	vs     11.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				  415.30     vs    394.37</p>
<p>    Interest and other income	    32.95     vs     23.51</p>
<p>    Interest expenses			48.07     vs     44.83</p>
<p>    Depreciation and amortisation	 8.27     vs     11.91</p>
<p>    Share of profits from associates   54.34     vs     36.61</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			   167.75     vs    144.30</p>
<p>    Taxation				   41.46     vs     33.41</p>
<p>    Minorities (gain)			12.84     vs     10.31</p>
<p>NOTE: DBS Land Ltd is a hotel and property group.</p>
